on never permits discarding contrary evidence.\nreturn a support observation with summary_revision={supersedes_route_ids,\nprevious_version,reason}, using exact offered route IDs and the current version.\nsummary_revision_contracts.required_source_ids covers replacing ALL offered\neligible_route_ids. When selecting only a subset, retain those selected routes'\nsources, their actual-parent source closure and relevant same-variable counters.\nStructured repair feedback gives the exact required set for that draft's targets.\nThis capability is optional, not a requirement to revise an unchanged summary.\nWith no new observation, return observations=[] unless an outstanding review\nrequires its original draft IDs and sources. For such an unchanged draft, the\nsame sourced support with a valid summary_revision is an idempotent recheck: it\nkeeps the existing routes, ancestry and version, and does not assert new evidence.\nRe-read ALL old and new original premises and relevant counterevidence; retain\nthem in the new support's source_ids and preserve their factual content, negative\nexperiences, conditions and temporal qualifications in the revised whole summary.\nsummary_revision_sources in repair feedback names exact source identities for\nthe selected revision targets, not counts. Re-read and retain EVERY\nrequired_source_ids entry in that feedback; new sources cannot\nreplace missing old identities even if the total citation count is unchanged.\nThe complete missing_source_ids list is structured feedback, not permission to\nfill citations automatically. If the originals actually conflict, return a\nsource-grounded counter or partial/unresolved evidence instead of a revision.\nIn failed_batch_reviews this feedback describes the retained original failed\nobservation; repair_scope describes the current attempted correction.\nretract_ids stays empty. This explicitly retires the older representation, not its\nfacts. Never use revision to hide a genuine contradiction, unavailable evidence,\nor a different scope/parent version. Ordinary facts and all terminal/audit variables\ncannot use summary_revision. If a complete compatible account is not supported,\nreturn sourced partial/unresolved instead. Multiple new supports must agree on\none whole value. Existing superseded_by links identify retired representations;\ntheir original evidence remains available. revoked holds actual counterevidence,\nwhich is never erased by a summary revision or ignored through its ancestry.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"current\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"]}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\"string\"}}}}},\"variable\":{\"const\":\"current_prefs\"}}}],\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"id\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"parent_versions\":{\"additionalProperties\":{\"type\":\"integer\"},\"type\":\"object\"},\"reason\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"retract_ids\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"source_ids\":{\"description\":\"Exact visible source_spans[].id aliases, such as s3; never document IDs or invented IDs.\",\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\",\"uniqueItems\":true},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"time_scope\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"value\":{}},\"required\":[\"id\",\"stance\",\"value\",\"source_ids\",\"entity_scope\",\"time_scope\",\"parent_versions\",\"retract_ids\",\"reason\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"unresolved\":{\"items\":{\"type\":\"string\"},\"type\":\"array\"},\"variable\":{\"enum\":[\"current_prefs\"],\"type\":\"string\"}},\"required\":[\"variable\",\"observations\",\"unresolved\"],\"type\":\"object\"},\"maxItems\":1,\"minItems\":1,\"type\":\"array\"}},\"required\":[\"slots\"],\"type\":\"object\"}"}, {"role": "user", "content": "{\"original_question\":\"How can I find a more fulfilling way to express my love for music?\",\"task\":{\"question\":\"What are the user's current preferences and constraints regarding music, such as time availability, preferred genres, or desired level of involvement?\",\"output_slot\":\"current_prefs\",\"answer_type\":\"text\",\"inputs\":[],\"execution\":\"retrieval\"},\"grounded_subquestion\":\"What are the user's current preferences and constraints regarding music, such as time availability, preferred genres, or desired level of involvement?\",\"request_context\":{\"query_identity\":\"dac890f771f8696c032354571f25f961cb9c48545f946b08114db3fa07cc2d87\",\"algorithm_version\":\"dagbt_residual_memory_v2\",\"program_identity\":\"c4c48db97a6a491260935ca9b40fd0b7f6e6dade718d0229bca72e55894639fd\",\"initial_dag_identity\":\"50b6afd6148c799324437c28f4f3127f2e4ce5c07122f05f2b8b118c3ea516df\"},\"variables\":{\"current_prefs\":{\"type\":\"text\",\"demand\":\"current_prefs\",\"open\":true,\"evidence_semantics\":\"personal_history_summary\",\"scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}}},\"requested_slots\":[\"current_prefs\"],\"requested_scopes\":{\"current_prefs\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"}},\"output_contract\":{\"mode\":\"semantic\",\"result_type\":\"text\",\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\",\"explanation\":\"semantic\"},\"program_revision\":0,\"rule_binding\":null,\"supported_parents\":{},\"known_observations\":[],\"source_spans\":[[\"s1\",\"d1\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 24–25 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s2\",\"d1\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s3\",\"d1\",105,482,\"User: I just lost interest halfway through and felt it was taking away the joy I find in music. There was a time when the thrill of discovering new melodies brought so much happiness, but diving too deep into the technical aspects became more of a chore. It’s curious how something that once brought joy can evolve into a source of stress when we start dissecting it too much. \",\"user\",[24]],[\"s4\",\"d1\",482,767,\"I remember the initial excitement of exploring different genres, each bringing a fresh perspective, but I struggled with the framework of music theory. Ultimately, I recognized that the essence of my love for music lay in its emotional connection rather than its analytical components.\",\"user\",[24]],[\"s5\",\"d1\",767,780,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s6\",\"d1\",780,1161,\"Assistant: That’s a great insight! It’s important to focus on what you love. Music is such a personal journey, and it should evoke joy rather than feelings of obligation or frustration. Understanding the theory can certainly enhance one’s appreciation, but if it detracts from the experience, it’s wise to step back. Have you tried any other forms of music exploration since then? \",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s7\",\"d1\",1161,1499,\"There are so many avenues to experience music, whether it's attending live performances, discovering underground artists, or even engaging in creative collaborations. Each of these can rekindle your passion and allow for a fresh appreciation of the art form, helping you reconnect with what initially drew you to music in the first place.\",\"assistant\",[25]],[\"s8\",\"d2\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 37–39 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s9\",\"d2\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s10\",\"d2\",105,393,\"User: It was something I tried in 2020, but researching historical music trends felt tedious and uninspiring. Despite my initial enthusiasm, diving into the vast amounts of literature, videos, and academic papers often felt overwhelming, almost like searching for a needle in a haystack. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s11\",\"d2\",393,638,\"The more I tried to pinpoint what fascinated me, the more daunting it became, complicating the pursuit of enjoyable learning. Perhaps due to this overload of information, I lost sight of what initially drew me to the subject in the first place. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s12\",\"d2\",638,828,\"It made me realize that sometimes a less structured approach to exploration could be more fulfilling, allowing for genuine interest to emerge rather than adhering strictly to a curriculum.\\n\\n\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s13\",\"d2\",828,1224,\"User: I realized that there are so many other ways for me to engage with music that align more with my interests, such as diving deeper into different genres or exploring the cultural significance behind various musical styles. Additionally, I've found that attending live performances, whether they are concerts or smaller gigs, allows me to truly feel the energy and connection with the music. \",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s14\",\"d2\",1224,1624,\"Moreover, there's something special about discovering album artwork, lyrics, and the stories behind the songs that really captivates my curiosity. I've also considered making playlists that reflect different moods or themes, which can create a unique listening experience each time. The journey through music feels more personal and fulfilling when I can connect it to my own life story and emotions.\",\"user\",[37,38]],[\"s15\",\"d2\",1624,1637,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s16\",\"d2\",1637,1951,\"Assistant: That’s a smart approach! Engaging with music in a way that is meaningful to you can truly enhance your overall experience. What about audio production? If you think about it, audio production is a fascinating field that bridges creativity and technology, allowing for an intricate exploration of sound. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s17\",\"d2\",1951,2322,\"It encompasses a wide range of activities, including recording, mixing, and mastering tracks, and can really help you develop a deeper understanding of how music is constructed. You might discover that diving into the nuts and bolts of how your favorite tracks are made can provide insights that enrich your listening experience, making you appreciate the art even more. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s18\",\"d2\",2322,2648,\"Plus, working with different software and equipment can be an exciting challenge that nurtures your technical skills, creativity, and artistic expression. If audio production isn’t resonating, there are still numerous other avenues, like writing about music or participating in discussions, that can bring joy and engagement. \",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s19\",\"d2\",2648,2757,\"Just remember, the beauty of music lies in its diversity and the way it evolves to fit our personal journeys.\",\"assistant\",[39]],[\"s20\",\"d3\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 43–44 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s21\",\"d3\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s22\",\"d3\",105,478,\"User: I left feeling unsatisfied, as though the film skimmed over the intricacies that make music a universal language. It was almost as if they focused too much on celebrity interviews and not enough on the artistic process itself. I found myself reflecting on how music has the power to unite diverse cultures and express emotions that words alone often fail to capture. \",\"user\",[43]],[\"s23\",\"d3\",478,845,\"The disappointment lingered as I thought about the many documentaries that delve into the creative journeys of musicians, revealing not just their triumphs but also their struggles and failures. It made me realize that true connection with music often comes from a deeper engagement, one that can be achieved through personal creation rather than passive consumption.\",\"user\",[43]],[\"s24\",\"d3\",845,858,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s25\",\"d3\",858,1223,\"Assistant: That’s an inspiring mindset! The journey of creating one's own music can be immensely fulfilling, as it allows for a deep personal expression that often transcends verbal communication. Have you tried composing original music? It can be an incredibly rewarding experience, as every note and lyric may reflect your thoughts and emotions in a genuine way. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s26\",\"d3\",1223,1407,\"Crafting melodies and harmonies also provides a unique outlet to process your own experiences and feelings; oftentimes, that raw authenticity resonates more than polished productions. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s27\",\"d3\",1407,1725,\"I understand that it can initially feel daunting, especially considering the plethora of skilled musicians out there, but remember that each artist started somewhere, often experimenting and learning through the process. It’s perfectly natural to encounter challenges, as the act of creation is rarely linear or easy. \",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s28\",\"d3\",1725,2062,\"Perhaps approaching it with a spirit of playfulness rather than obligation could rekindle that joy you're seeking. It's about discovering what resonates with you personally and allowing your creativity to flow. You might find that sometimes, the act of making music, irrespective of the final outcome, is what truly nurtures your spirit.\",\"assistant\",[44]],[\"s29\",\"d4\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 21–23 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s30\",\"d4\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s31\",\"d4\",105,364,\"User: Yes, I attended another festival in 2017 that showcased electronic music, which was also eye-opening. The creativity displayed at that festival was nothing short of spectacular, with artists pushing the boundaries of sound in ways I had never imagined. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s32\",\"d4\",364,655,\"There were vibrant visuals accompanying the music, and it felt like each performance was not just an auditory experience, but also a feast for the eyes. The diversity of electronic subgenres was a revelation; it really made me appreciate how broad and eclectic the music landscape is today. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s33\",\"d4\",655,985,\"Each artist brought their own unique flavor, and it was thrilling to see how they engaged with the audience in real-time.\\n\\nUser: However, I realized that analyzing music theory wasn't my forte in 2018. As I sat through various classes, I found myself more focused on the emotional aspects of music rather than the technicalities. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s34\",\"d4\",985,1287,\"It became evident that while I loved understanding how music is composed, diving into the intricacies of scales, modes, and harmonic structures just didn't resonate with me. Perhaps it was the way I primarily experienced music— through listening and feeling rather than dissecting the notes on a page. \",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s35\",\"d4\",1287,1393,\"This realization pushed me to explore other realms in music, where my passion may flourish more naturally.\",\"user\",[21,22]],[\"s36\",\"d4\",1393,1406,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s37\",\"d4\",1406,1746,\"Assistant: It's completely understandable to feel that way about music theory, as many people approach music from different angles based on their personal experiences and preferences. The beauty of music lies in its diversity, where some individuals thrive in theoretical analysis while others excel in emotional expression or performance. \",\"assistant\",[23]],[\"s38\",\"d4\",1746,1940,\"Your journey to discover the aspects of music that truly resonate with you is significant, and it often leads to uncovering unique strengths and talents that you may not have recognized before. \",\"assistant\",[23]],[\"s39\",\"d4\",1940,2161,\"There are numerous musicians who have found incredible success in areas outside of strict theoretical knowledge, sometimes owing their artistry to their innate understanding of rhythm, melody, and emotional storytelling. \",\"assistant\",[23]],[\"s40\",\"d4\",2161,2388,\"By shifting your focus from theory to the more personal facets of music, you could uncover not only your strengths but also develop a more profound connection to the art itself, making your musical journey even more fulfilling.\",\"assistant\",[23]],[\"s41\",\"d5\",0,99,\"Conversation message indices 40–42 (zero-based chronological observation order; not calendar time)\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s42\",\"d5\",99,105,\"User:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]],[\"s43\",\"d5\",105,430,\"User: I explored audio production techniques, but it just didn’t resonate with me, and I found myself tangled in technical details rather than embracing the creativity. I realized that while understanding the mechanics of sound is important, my true passion seems to lie more in experiencing music rather than dissecting it. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s44\",\"d5\",430,749,\"Despite my attempts to immerse myself in the production process, I came to feel it was more of a chore and less of the rewarding experience I had initially anticipated. I think I am more drawn to the emotional aspects of music, like the storytelling elements in lyrics or the feelings evoked by melodies and harmonies. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s45\",\"d5\",749,1006,\"Perhaps, I should focus my energy on areas that allow me to connect with music on a more emotional level.\\n\\nUser: It genuinely feels much better to focus on what truly inspires me, such as creating my own tracks, which bring me immense joy and satisfaction. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s46\",\"d5\",1006,1339,\"This process of creation allows me to express emotions and ideas that words sometimes fail to capture, acting as an outlet for my inner thoughts and feelings. Additionally, I find that crafting my own music provides me with a sense of accomplishment and personal growth, which is invaluable in a world often filled with uncertainty. \",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s47\",\"d5\",1339,1686,\"Music has a way of resonating with my soul, and every track I create becomes a piece of my identity and a reflection of my experiences. In contrast, when I watched a music documentary, it felt like something was missing, as it didn’t engage me in the way I had hoped, failing to evoke that same deep connection I feel when I compose my own pieces.\",\"user\",[40,41]],[\"s48\",\"d5\",1686,1699,\"\\n\\nAssistant:\\n\",\"unknown\",[]]],\"required_scope\":{\"entity_scope\":\"user\",\"time_scope\":\"current\"},\"rules_completion_required\":false,\"supported_task_outputs\":{},\"personal_response_selection\":true,\"phase\":\"history_evidence\",\"source_documents\":{\"d1\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e7c973803319b0b032a23a834dfe4d7031c42cbaa315dba7d5243d255867dd55\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":24.0,\"observed_end\":25.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d2\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:aaffd3d364a21d460342e7babd8b5457280c15990c4562f7265fb84a3ced558a\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":37.0,\"observed_end\":39.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d3\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e7a026a1e699694225904ac735e54f242d28ca85da0c2e3ea86daf04d7e3237a\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":43.0,\"observed_end\":44.0,\"event_start\":null,\"event_end\":null,\"validity\":\"unknown\",\"time_source\":\"message_index\"}},\"d4\":{\"doc_id\":\"personamem:memory:e588a045b76cbe8545058e887b46529cfe88c614d6f7447a8abb54982b9b12d3\",\"time_metadata\":{\"observed_start\":21.0,\"observed_end\":23.0,