turn sourced partial/unresolved instead. Multiple new supports must agree on\none whole value. Existing superseded_by links identify retired representations;\ntheir original evidence remains available. revoked holds actual counterevidence,\nwhich is never erased by a summary revision or ignored through its ancestry.\n\nThe four public_options correspond in list order to (a), (b), (c), (d). They are candidate answers, not evidence. Put the selected label only in final_prediction; keep the entire response as the required JSON object with all other fields required by its schema. Never return a bare label.\n\nshared_history_texts stores exact text values used more than once. In\nsupported_parents and known_observations, value_ref replaces only the value\nfield with the exact string at that key; all other fields remain unchanged.\nIf grounded_subquestion_parts is present, concatenate its literal strings and\nthe exact strings named by {\"text_ref\": key} to recover grounded_subquestion.\nDecode these references before reasoning. They are storage references, not\nnew observations, citations, review permissions or evidence of agreement.\nReferences are input-only. Return full typed values in output observations\nunder the unchanged response schema; never return value_ref or text_ref.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"audit_verdict\":{\"enum\":[\"supported\",\"unknown\",\"conflict\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"final_prediction\":{\"enum\":[\"a\",\"b\",\"c\",\"d\",null],\"type\":[\"string\",\"null\"]},\"semantic_answer\":{},\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"user\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"past\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":